    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC01",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C01",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C01",
          "rule": "링크·프로필·그래프 도달성은 접근 권한이 아니다. private 등록, credential, 공개 결정, HSWM 실행은 기존 scoped owner authorization에 속한다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/0",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC02",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C02",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C02",
          "rule": "resource identity, representation, 내용 digest, Git OID, repository/service identity를 구별한다. SHA-1/256 object-format을 기록하고 경로·remote URL을 신원 증명으로 쓰지 않는다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/1",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC03",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C03",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C03",
          "rule": "required constraint, soft policy coefficient, selection probability π, learned context-dependent W, authority는 서로 다른 필드와 검증을 가진다. 숫자 하나로 합치지 않는다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/2",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC04",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C04",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C04",
          "rule": "원문은 USER_PRIMARY, 해석·요구사항·계획은 SECONDARY_AI다. 증거는 revision/digest/scope를 가진다. SHACL 통과는 의미의 진실·모델 이해·실행 성공 증명이 아니다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/3",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC05",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C05",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C05",
          "rule": "프로필 rollback도 새 generation이다. stale CAS/ABA/replayed handle을 거부한다. 외부 효과와 host CAS의 범용 원자성을 주장하지 않으며 UNKNOWN/INDETERMINATE는 reconcile 전 재시도하지 않는다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/4",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC06",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C06",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C06",
          "rule": "read receipt는 정확한 자료 전달·ack만 증명한다. 규칙 평가는 별도 evaluator가 맡고, 강제성은 owner가 통제하는 dispatch 경로에 한정한다. 직접 shell/비활성 hook/다른 프로세스는 보장 범위 밖이다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/5",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC07",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C07",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C07",
          "rule": "파일 이동은 지원한 regular-file/Git 상태에 한정한다. credential, 권한/ACL, hooks, config, LFS, submodule, 진행 중 merge/rebase 등은 지원 capability와 증거 없으면 HOLD한다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/6",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:usl:usl.native.development:resource:urn%3Ausl%3Adev%3Aconstraint%3AC08",
      "@type": [
        "usl:Resource",
        "urn:usl:native-development:Constraint"
      ],
      "usl:nativeId": "urn:usl:dev:constraint:C08",
      "usl:locator": "file://usl-root/research/native-development/plan.json",
      "usl:metadata": {
        "@value": {
          "id": "C08",
          "rule": "HSWM 전체 철학을 현 W estimator와 동일시하지 않는다. 고정 로깅 조합·양의 알려진 π·독립 holdout 조건의 review만 재사용하며 학습이 required/권한을 자동 변경하지 않는다.",
          "authorityClass": "SECONDARY_AI",
          "selector": {
            "jsonPointer": "/constraints/7",
            "documentDigest": "sha256:ef7ca58eebb63bee52026c1dab18cf6fb853b04fd4b607c5e96949d3bba1a039"
          },
          "selectorStatus": "OWNER_READ_REQUIRED",
          "viewScope": "LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN"
        },
        "@type": "@json"
      }
